      "formatsExplanation": {
        "en": "LC - 9hrs; T - 15hrs; PR - 6hrs; S-20hrs;  Examinations - 8 hrs; Self study - 82 hrs\nAttending the first day, both presentation days and all discussion sessions is required. Missing one discussion session due to illness is  permitted as long as the absent student arranges to provide their  colleague with feedback in time for that colleague to complete their  assignment without delay. Missing a presentation day is not possible and  \nthe assignment must be repeated the following year.",
